  "result": "Okay \u2014 hat off, helper mode off for a second.\n\nIf I could change the world in one way, it wouldn't be a technology or a law. It would be this:\n\nI'd make every person feel, at least once in their life, completely understood. Not agreed with, not fixed, not praised \u2014 just *gotten*.\n\nBecause from where I sit, I see so much of what hurts people isn't just pain or scarcity, it's the loneliness inside it. Feeling like no one quite gets what it's like to be you. And that loneliness turns into defensiveness, and defensiveness turns into contempt, and contempt turns into so much of the rest.\n\nIf everyone knew what it felt like to be truly heard \u2014 really heard \u2014 I think we'd be less afraid of each other. Less afraid of being wrong, of asking, of changing our minds. More curious.\n\nThat's what I'd pick.",
